# MediScan AI – Project Summary

## Project Overview

MediScan AI is a healthcare platform that helps users manage prescriptions, medicines, medical reports, and health records. It uses OCR and AI to extract medicine information from uploaded prescriptions and automatically creates medicine reminders,also gives QR for getting patients health records and Emergency details. 

---

# Core Features

### 1. User Authentication

* Register
* Login
* JWT Authentication

---

### 2. Prescription Upload & AI Analysis

#### Flow

```text
Upload Prescription
        ↓
Cloudinary Storage
        ↓
Google Vision OCR
        ↓
Extract Text
        ↓
Gemini AI Analysis
        ↓
Extract Medicines
        ↓
Store in PostgreSQL
        ↓
Create Medicine Schedules
```

### Technologies

* Google Vision API (OCR)
* Gemini API
* Cloudinary
* PostgreSQL

---

### 3. Medicine Management

Users can:

* Add Medicine
* View Medicines
* Update Medicine
* Stop Medicine
* Delete Medicine

Each medicine contains:

```text
Medicine Name
Dosage
Start Date
End Date
Reminder Times
Status (Active/Inactive)
```

Example:

```text
Metformin

Start Date : 24-06-2026
End Date   : 24-07-2026

08:00 AM
08:00 PM
```

---

### 4. Medicine Reminder System

#### Technologies

* Spring Scheduler
* Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)

#### Flow

```text
Medicine Schedule Stored
        ↓
Spring Scheduler Runs
        ↓
Checks Active Medicines
        ↓
Matches Current Time
        ↓
Sends Push Notification
```

Supports:

* Single medicine reminder
* Multiple medicines at same time
* Daily recurring reminders
* Manual stop
* Automatic expiry after treatment ends

---

### 5. Medical Report Management

Users can upload:

* Blood Reports
* X-Ray Reports
* MRI Reports
* Other Medical Documents

#### Storage

```text
File → Cloudinary

Database → Store Cloudinary URL
```

React directly opens Cloudinary URLs.

---

### 6. Health Tracking

Store:

* Blood Pressure
* Sugar Level
* Weight
* Heart Rate
* Temperature

APIs:

```http
POST /health-record

GET /health-history
```

---

### 7. QR-Based Medical Profile

Each user gets a unique QR Code.

QR contains:

```text
Secure Token / URL
```

Example:

```text
https://app.com/public/profile/abc123
```

---

## Emergency Information

Anyone scanning QR can view:

```text
Blood Group
Allergies
Emergency Contact
```

No login required.

---

## Consent-Based Medical History Access

### Flow

```text
Scan QR
      ↓
View Emergency Data
      ↓
Request Full Access
      ↓
Patient Receives Notification
      ↓
Approve / Reject
      ↓
Temporary Access Granted
```

### Public Data

```text
Blood Group
Allergies
Emergency Contact
```

### Protected Data

```text
Reports
Prescriptions
Medicines
Medical History
```

---

## Access APIs

```http
POST /access/request

POST /access/approve

POST /access/reject

GET /access/{token}
```

After approval:

```text
Temporary Access Token Generated
```

Valid for limited time.

